# Later, not this desk

This is one family’s homeschool on Rocky. Do not add selling-scale accounts, extra families, or observer roles unless Joe asks.

Save for later:

- More than one academy or family on the same server
- Observers (grandparents, tutors) who can look but not change
- Paid plans, billing, or a public signup
- A marketplace or shared curriculum store

Roles stay thin for now: `student | teacher | admin | super_admin`. Joe is the only super admin. Kim is a teacher. Gregory is a student.
